              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The team discussed the current digital marketing efforts, primarily using Meta (Facebook and Instagram) for lead generation, and highlighted the need to optimize these campaigns for better lead quality and cost efficiency.",
